When creating this diagram, please follow these guidelines:
1. The diagram should illustrate the deployment architecture and CI/CD pipeline of the VIP Platform
2. Include all stages in the deployment workflow from code commit to production deployment
3. Show the tools and systems involved in the CI/CD process
4. Illustrate approval gates, validation steps, and rollback mechanisms
5. Use the standard color scheme and symbols from our diagram guidelines
6. Export as PNG with a resolution of at least 1200x800
7. Include a legend explaining all symbols used

